{"name": "Logic Arrows", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything in this world is constructed from simple components: <strong>Arrows</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each arrow performs a single simple operation on a signal, resulting in complex behavior. The game introduces you to the fundamentals of digital logic and computer architecture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"signal blocks itself in a loop\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210250/extras/65b7c56b31253cd0a85a0149367f301a.poster.avif?t=1789052598\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210250/extras/65b7c56b31253cd0a85a0149367f301a.webm?t=1789052598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210250/extras/65b7c56b31253cd0a85a0149367f301a.mp4?t=1789052598\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUILD</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For Beginners:</strong> Solve minimalist puzzles and watch the flow of signals.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"full adder with simple display\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"280\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210250/extras/be7e876b05654bd9c8eb9fd271f94618.poster.avif?t=1789052598\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210250/extras/be7e876b05654bd9c8eb9fd271f94618.webm?t=1789052598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210250/extras/be7e876b05654bd9c8eb9fd271f94618.mp4?t=1789052598\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For Engineers:</strong> Push the limits. Build calculators, displays, memory blocks, or even a fully functional CPU.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OPTIMIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no \"right\" solution, only <i>your</i> solution. Once you solve a puzzle, the real challenge begins: can you make it smaller? Can you make it faster? </p> </div>", "short_desc": "Logic Arrows is a sandbox game where you design your own mechanisms: from logic gates to an entire computer. Use simple elements to build complex systems, solve engineering challenges and master computer logic.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4210250/2eff18be2aa989a9d6e9fab2b6bc4aecfd87978a/header.jpg?t=1789052598", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Programming", "Logic", "Sandbox", "Simulation", "Automation", "Education"], "developers": "Artem Yashin", "publishers": "Artem Yashin", "release_date": "Nov 10, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4210250", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 September 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/7wfC44Zw0BM", "first_seen": 1788991200.0, "review_rank": 3}